1. 固定 NCCL 环境

训练前先执行，避免重新登录后又加载 /usr/local/lib/libnccl.so.2：

NCCL_LIB=$(python - <<'PY'
from importlib.metadata import distribution
print(distribution("nvidia-nccl-cu12").locate_file("nvidia/nccl/lib"))
PY
)

export LD_LIBRARY_PATH="$NCCL_LIB${LD_LIBRARY_PATH:+:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH}"
export LD_PRELOAD="$NCCL_LIB/libnccl.so.2"

echo "NCCL_LIB=$NCCL_LIB"

验证：

python - <<'PY'
import torch
print("Torch:", torch.__version__)
print("CUDA:", torch.version.cuda)
print("NCCL:", torch.cuda.nccl.version())
print("GPU count:", torch.cuda.device_count())
PY

NCCL 应显示：

(2, 29, 3)
2. 检查 Python 依赖
python -m pip check

若只有 torchaudio 或 torchvision 版本冲突，而当前训练不使用它们，可以先卸载：

python -m pip uninstall -y torchvision torchaudio
3. 清理旧版本缓存
cd ~/k50063112/torchtitan

find torchtitan -type d -name "__pycache__" \
    -prune -exec rm -rf {} +

rm -rf ~/.triton/cache
rm -rf ~/.cache/torch_inductor
rm -rf /tmp/torchinductor_${USER}
4. 检查关键源码没有放错位置
grep -nE \
'from \.(rope|sharding)|Qwen35VisionEncoder|GatedDeltaNet' \
torchtitan/distributed/pipeline_parallel.py

这里应该没有输出。

再检查之前的 FLA 维度修复：

grep -nE \
'xq = xq.reshape|xk = xk.reshape|xv = xv.reshape|xz = xz.reshape|beta = beta.reshape' \
torchtitan/models/qwen3_5/model.py

应该能看到类似：

xq = xq.reshape(bs, seqlen, -1, self.key_head_dim)
xk = xk.reshape(bs, seqlen, -1, self.key_head_dim)
xv = xv.reshape(bs, seqlen, -1, self.value_head_dim)
xz = xz.reshape(bs, seqlen, -1, self.value_head_dim)
beta = beta.reshape(bs, seqlen, -1)
5. 做语法和导入测试
python -m py_compile \
    torchtitan/models/qwen3_5/model.py \
    torchtitan/models/qwen3_5/parallelize.py \
    torchtitan/distributed/pipeline_parallel.py

然后：

PYTHONPATH=. python - <<'PY'
from torchtitan.models.qwen3_5.model import GatedDeltaNet
from torchtitan.distributed.pipeline_parallel import pipeline_llm

print("GatedDeltaNet import OK")
print("pipeline_llm import OK")
PY
